Q: How can I make a DataFrame from a ColumnTransformer composed by LOO Encoder, OHE and Ordinal Encoder?
A: <p>I have this same issue once in the past.</p>
<p>If you don't mind using a subclass of ColumnTransformer you can create it and just modify to call <code>get_feature_names()</code> when <code>get_feature_names_out()</code> was not available.</p>
